				1028,
				50
			],
			"Message": "build(Wind): Regenerate service interfaces from VS Code upstream and update domain references\n\nRegenerate all Effect-TS service interfaces under Source/Effect/Generated/ from VS Code upstream sources, adding 513 service catalog entries and 552 command catalog entries with standardized formatting. Update all documentation and configuration references from land.playform.cloud to editor.land domain.\n\nKey changes:\n- Regenerate 44 service interface files (IAgentHost*, IChat*, ITerminal*, ISession*, etc.) from VS Code upstream with consistent PascalCase and spacing conventions\n- Add CommandCatalog.ts with 552 command registrations from VS Code workbench contributions\n- Add ServiceCatalog.ts with 513 service decorator entries mapping to generated interface files\n- Update README.md, Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md, and .github/Update.md for editor.land domain migration\n- Bump effect dependency from 3.21.2 to 3.21.3 and @types/node from 25.9.1 to 25.9.2\n- Apply mechanical formatting to Source/ESBuild.js and tsconfig.json (array expansion, consistent indentation)\n\nImpact: Restores generated upstream interfaces deleted in previous refactor, aligns service definitions with current VS Code upstream, and completes domain migration to editor.land.",
			"SHA": "840916f90b1b9893141443bdd64414d856c21385"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T00:13:45Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⡏⠀⠀⠀",
				943,
				300
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Migrate service layers to synchronous factory pattern and remove generated upstream interfaces\n\nReplace Effect.gen-based Layer.effect service construction with synchronous factory functions reading from globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__ across all Wind service implementations. This eliminates Effect runtime overhead during service initialization and simplifies the service layer architecture.\n\nKey changes:\n- Convert 25+ Live.ts service files from Layer.effect(Effect.gen(...)) to Layer.succeed(factory()) pattern\n- Refactor TauriIPC from Effect.gen to direct function returning IPCService\n- Simplify ESBuild configuration files (BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig, Wind.js, index.js) and Source/ESBuild.js with consistent formatting\n- Delete 200+ generated upstream service interfaces under Source/Effect/Generated/ (ServiceCatalog, CommandCatalog, and all I*Upstream.ts files)\n- Delete 15 Workbench*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts bridge shape files\n- Add TerminalPropertyChanged event to SkyEvent.ts for terminal property change notifications\n- Minor formatting fixes in MistWebSocketTransport.ts\n\nImpact: Reduced service initialization latency, simpler mental model for service construction, and removal of stale generated code that was blocking regeneration from updated VS Code upstream sources.",
			"SHA": "4f8fe2c193f1cce55af8b94bc452d645d87575d2"
		}
	],
	"TimeStamp": 1782484737635
